## Where the work comes from

This file is about how code is written. What gets written, in what order, and what it has to
show is the delivery graph:

```console
$ praxis dashboard    # where this repository stands, composed from the record
$ praxis ready        # what could be started now, and what would refuse the rest
$ praxis pick-up <TS.…> --asked-by human:<who>
```

`using-praxis` is the index. `adopt-the-method` is the argument for why none of the above
was written for you.
